{"unit_id": "tag:0F1K:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n构造仿射概形（affine scheme）的结构层（structure sheaf）时，首先构造它在仿射开集（affine opens）上的值，然后扩张到所有开集（opens）。类似的构造通常有助于在概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>上构造阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的复形（complexes）。回顾<MATH_0002>表示<MATH_0003>的仿射开集（affine opens）的范畴（category），其拓扑（topology）由标准 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）给出，见拓扑（Topologies），定义<REF_0001>。提醒读者，<MATH_0004>的拓扑斯（topos）是<MATH_0005>的小（small）Zariski 拓扑斯（topos），见拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0002>。本节用<MATH_0006>表示配备混沌（chaotic）拓扑（topology）的同一个底层范畴（underlying category），即使层（sheaves）与预层（presheaves）一致。我们得到景（sites）的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0007>\n，如景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），节<REF_0003>中所述。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topos", "target_term": "拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "topos", "target_term": "拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "chaotic", "target_term": "混沌"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine sche