{"unit_id": "tag:0F1L:proof", "translation": "（函子（functor）<MATH_0001>根据景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），节<REF_0001>中的讨论是全忠实（fully faithful）的。）除去一个与空（empty）集（set）有关的问题，这由非常一般的景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0002>得到；该引理的假设由概形（Schemes），引理<REF_0003>和景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0004>满足。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为绕过这个问题，用<MATH_0002>表示空（empty）对象（object）<MATH_0003>具有两个覆盖（coverings）的景（site），即<MATH_0004>和空（empty）覆盖（covering）（相关讨论见景（Sites），例<REF_0005>）。于是有景（sites）的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0005>\n。上述论证适用于第一个箭头。然后留给读者验证，<MATH_0006>作为<MATH_0007>的一个对象（object），属于（全忠实（fully faithful）的）函子（functor）<MATH_0008>的本质（essential）像（image），当且仅当<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中为零。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "essential", "target_term": "本质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "比较函子"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调", "context": "章节名"}, {"s